/E (Here we see the hierarchy of structural problems. The Metropolitan Area Periphery is the dominant feature together with the Center. This tells that long commuting times are largely a result of urban planning: if you live in these areas, you face a structural disadvantage regardless of personal efficiency.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
